und: the new settings default to Poly, centred, gated and following the keys, and only a project with more than 64 Nano notes sounding at once plays differently.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"hiero-ledger/hiero-sdk-js","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:49:11Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"9af1e5f88cf7aaff2394662291e9031852a30b96","github_link":"https://github.com/hiero-ledger/hiero-sdk-js/commit/9af1e5f88cf7aaff2394662291e9031852a30b96","commit_subject":"test: add unit tests for TokenRelationship (#4316)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Badsender-com/LePatron.email","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:48:56Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"44e242a7c7422a65a128282ae3f9a328f10c8048","github_link":"https://github.com/Badsender-com/LePatron.email/commit/44e242a7c7422a65a128282ae3f9a328f10c8048","commit_subject":"fix(server): the HTTPS redirection goes to the configured host","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"cardstack/boxel","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:48:50Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"3b361cef46831c9d05bf4abbc06c062ab4f47655","github_link":"https://github.com/cardstack/boxel/commit/3b361cef46831c9d05bf4abbc06c062ab4f47655","commit_subject":"Keep the reader's own reaction flat under a tool call","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"flexprice/flexprice","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:48:47Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"b1344cd5424962c4b0c69e33fe0d2d61b5784058","github_link":"https://github.com/flexprice/flexprice/commit/b1344cd5424962c4b0c69e33fe0d2d61b5784058","commit_subject":"fix(payments): deliver attempt webhooks with a warm cache, skip redelivered declines","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ZenUml/web-sequence","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:48:40Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"b9c02be3da5dda57d980811f05d61cedf506fd84","github_link":"https://github.com/ZenUml/web-sequence/commit/b9c02be3da5dda57d980811f05d61cedf506fd84","commit_subject":"ci: cut staging pipeline wall time (parallel workers, local E2E off the critical path, chromium-only ga